      <PrimaryExemptPurposeTxt>The B.R.I.D.G.E. Lab a Live Well San Diego Partner addresses the mental health challenges faced by young individuals in Southern California. Through evidence-based curriculum and adaptive programming we empower youth to navigate adversity fostering resilience and contributing to equitable empowered communities. Our programs include lesson workshops preventative services and counseling for youth their families and the adults that support youth.</PrimaryExemptPurposeTxt>
      <ProgramSrvcAccomplishmentGrp>
        <DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>The BRIDGE Lab completed rendering services to three different school districts across San Diego and Los Angeles counties. These services included preventative mental health care classes for youth workshop learning for parents to better support the mental well being of their children and professional development for educators to understand how mental health issues can impact performance in the classroom. We provided direct service to over 2000 youth and families and over 150 educators.</DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>
        <GrantsAndAllocationsAmt>25000</GrantsAndAllocationsAmt>
        <ProgramServiceExpensesAmt>13575</ProgramServiceExpensesAmt>
      </ProgramSrvcAccomplishmentGrp>
      <ProgramSrvcAccomplishmentGrp>
        <DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>BASECAMP is a 3 day summer camp for high school youth to learn about creating solutions to challenges in their community. Youth receive mentorship guidance leadership skills and social emotional skills. Youth have the opportunity to win $1000 in scholarship money. This event is hosted annually at SDSU.</DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>
        <GrantsAndAllocationsAmt>0</GrantsAndAllocationsAmt>
        <ProgramServiceExpensesAmt>421</ProgramServiceExpensesAmt>
      </ProgramSrvcAccomplishmentGrp>
      <ProgramSrvcAccomplishmentGrp>
        <DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>Designed for educators youth leaders caregivers and professionals across sectors the Healing Circle integrates simple sustainable wellness tools into participants daily routines. It helps organizations build cultures of care and equips leaders to show up with greater clarity resilience and presence.</DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>
